{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, fully responsive Shopify Liquid section for Kiss & Kry titled "Giving Back – Outgrown, Not Outworn."
    
    IMPORTANT: Use the uploaded reference image as the exact visual design reference. Reproduce the layout, proportions, spacing, typography, colours, card styles, image placements and overall composition as closely as possible.
    
    Do not redesign, simplify or reinterpret the layout.
    
    The section should communicate Kiss & Kry's sustainable babywear return and redistribution initiative.
    
    1. OVERALL DESIGN & COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Create a full-width premium editorial-style section.
    
    Main background:
    
    Deep muted olive green: #5E6848 (approximate).
    
    Primary text: Warm ivory #F6F2E5.
    
    Secondary text: Muted sage-beige #C7C7AD.
    
    Accent colour: Warm mustard gold #E9AC29.
    
    Light card background: #F5F0E9.
    
    Dark olive card: #495239.
    
    Borders: Subtle translucent sage/olive.
    
    Design characteristics:
    
    Luxury editorial aesthetic.
    
    Premium babywear branding.
    
    Minimal, sophisticated and spacious.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Subtle background decorative circular outlines.
    
    No unnecessary gradients.
    
    No excessive shadows.
    
    Avoid generic ecommerce layouts.
    
    Use Montserrat for all typography.
    
    2. SECTION ONE – HERO / GIVING BACK INTRODUCTION
    
    Create a two-column desktop layout.
    
    LEFT COLUMN – 48% WIDTH
    
    Small eyebrow heading:
    "GIVING BACK"
    
    Add a short horizontal mustard-gold line before the label.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Outgrown,
    Not Outworn."
    
    Typography:
    
    Large, bold Montserrat.
    
    Approximately 40–44px desktop.
    
    Warm ivory colour.
    
    Tight line height.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Description:
    
    "At Kiss & Kry, we believe true luxury goes beyond premium fabrics and adorable designs. It's compassion, community and sustainability — and it sits at the heart of our 'Giving Back' initiative."
    
    Use 14px text with comfortable line spacing.
    
    Below the description, create an editorial image composition:
    
    Large vertical image on the left showing a premium cardboard return box with Kiss & Kry branding.
    
    Smaller rectangular image on the right showing a baby garment being held or folded.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Subtle overlapping composition.
    
    Add small ivory pill labels:
    "Step 01 · Return"
    "Step 02 · Redistribute"
    
    Add a circular olive-and-gold seal overlapping the images, featuring a return/recycle arrow and small curved text:
    "RETURN • REWARD • REDISTRIBUTE"
    
    RIGHT COLUMN – 52% WIDTH
    
    Small eyebrow heading:
    "OUR UNIQUE INITIATIVE"
    
    Add a thin horizontal line extending towards the right.
    
    Create two vertically stacked process cards.
    
    STEP 01 – RETURN & REWARD
    
    Card styling:
    
    Background: #F5F0E9.
    
    Rounded corners: 22px.
    
    Generous internal padding.
    
    Light, premium appearance.
    
    Top section:
    
    Circular olive icon background.
    
    Minimal package/return box icon.
    
    Small label: "STEP 01"
    
    Heading: "Return & Reward", Description:
    
    "When your little one outgrows our beautiful clothes, don't let them gather dust. Send them back to us!"
    
    Reward information inside a highlighted horizontal pill/card:
    
    Golden circular badge containing "15%"
    
    Text: "Off your next Kiss & Kry purchase"
    
    Supporting text: "as a token of our appreciation."
    
    Use warm beige/gold background and subtle gold border.
    
    STEP 02 – REDISTRIBUTE & REJOICE
    
    Card styling:
    
    Dark olive background: #495239.
    
    Rounded corners: 22px.
    
    Ivory text.
    
    Top section:
    
    Circular icon.
    
    Minimal home icon.
    
    Small label: "STEP 02"
    
    Heading: "Redistribute & Rejoice"
    
    Description:
    
    "We don't just collect used clothes — we make sure they find a new home within our community."
    
    Below the description, create three small outlined pill indicators with check icons:
    
    Inspected
    
    Cleaned
    
    Given to families in need
    
    Connect both cards visually using a small circular golden arrow positioned between them.
    
    3. SECTION TWO – THE IMPACT
    
    Maintain the same deep olive background.
    
    Create a two-column introduction row.
    
    LEFT SIDE
    
    Eyebrow label:
    "THE IMPACT"
    
    Include a short golden horizontal line.
    
    Heading:
    
    "Making a Difference
    Together."
    
    Use bold ivory typography, approximately 30px.
    
    RIGHT SIDE
    
    Description:
    
    "By joining our Giving Back programme, you're directly helping build a more sustainable future — and supporting those less fortunate. Small actions make a big difference, and with your help we can extend the life of our premium baby clothes and reduce waste."
    
    Use muted sage-beige text, 14px with comfortable line height.
    
    THREE IMPACT CARDS
    
    Below the introduction, create three equal-width columns.
    
    Each column should have:
    
    Thin subtle top border.
    
    Circular outline icon holder.
    
    Small mustard-gold icon.
    
    Ivory heading.
    
    Muted beige description., CARD 01
    
    Icon: Leaf
    
    Heading:
    "Sustainability"
    
    Description:
    "By recycling our garments, we reduce waste and promote a more sustainable fashion industry. Every returned item is one less piece of clothing that could end up in a landfill."
    
    CARD 02
    
    Icon: Users / Community
    
    Heading:
    "Community Support"
    
    Description:
    "By passing returned clothes on to those in need, we strengthen our community and support families who may not have the means to buy new clothes."
    
    CARD 03
    
    Icon: Heart
    
    Heading:
    "Customer Connection"
    
    Description:
    "This initiative lets us build a deeper bond with our customers — a sense of shared purpose and mutual benefit that goes well beyond the checkout."
    
    Spacing:
    
    Three equal columns.
    
    Approximately 40px gap.
    
    Generous vertical spacing.
    
    Consistent alignment.
    
    4. SECTION THREE – FINAL CTA / JOIN US
    
    Create a large, premium rounded rectangular panel below the impact cards.
    
    This panel must have a warm ivory background (#F5F0E0).
    
    Layout:
    
    Two columns.
    
    Left: 55%.
    
    Right: 45%.
    
    Internal padding: 48–50px.
    
    Border radius: 28px.
    
    Image must have rounded corners.
    
    LEFT CONTENT
    
    Eyebrow label:
    "JOIN US"
    
    Add a short mustard-gold line before the label.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Join Us in Making
    a Difference."
    
    Use large olive-green bold typography, approximately 32px.
    
    Description:
    
    "When you choose Kiss & Kry, you're not just dressing your baby in the finest clothing — you're contributing to a cycle of generosity and care. Together, we can create a brighter, more sustainable future for all our children."
    
    Below, create a highlighted testimonial-style message with a thin vertical golden line on the left.
    
    Text:
    
    "Thank you for being a valued member of the Kiss & Kry family. Together, we can make a difference, one adorable outfit at a time."
    
    Small signature:
    "♥ WITH LOVE, TEAM KISS & KRY"
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(40px,6vw,84px) clamp(22px,5vw,76px);background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-family:var(--font-body-family,'Montserrat',sans-serif);position:relative;overflow:hidden}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__wrap{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:1320px;margin:auto}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.92fr 1fr;gap:clamp(36px,7vw,96px)}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin:0 0 18px;color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }};font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow:before{content:'';width:29px;height:1px;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,52px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.04em}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro,.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-copy{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }}}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage{position:relative;height:330px;max-width:520px;margin-top:30px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo{position:absolute;overflow:hidden;border-radius:16px;background:#dedbd2}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--one{inset:0 39% 0 0}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--two{width:48%;height:68%;right:0;top:16%;border:5px solid {{ block.settings.background_color }};box-sizing:border-box}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo img,.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo svg{background:#ddd8cf}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__missing{position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:8px;right:8px;background:#38402d;color:#fff;border-radius:7px;padding:7px;text-align:center;font-size:10px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tag{position:absolute;z-index:2;bottom:15px;background:{{ block.settings.text_color }};color:#38402d;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:10px;font-weight:600}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tag--a{left:12px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tag--b{right:4px;bottom:30px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:51%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:94px;height:94px;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.accent_color }};border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.dark_color }};display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.1em}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal svg{width:28px;height:28px;color:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__right .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow:after{content:'';height:1px;background:rgba(199,199,173,.45);flex:1}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards{position:relative;display:grid;gap:16px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{padding:28px;border-radius:22px;background:{{ block.settings.light_color }};color:#30352a}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark{background:{{ block.settings.dark_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cardhead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;margin-bottom:16px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__round-icon{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#495239;color:#fff}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__round-icon{background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};color:#353a29}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__round-icon svg{width:22px;height:22px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#62664f}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step{color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }}}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card h3{margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.2}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card p{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#45493e}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark p{color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }}}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;margin-top:17px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #c49a45;border-radius:15px;background:#f0e2c4;color:#3d402f}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__percent{width:46px;height:46px;flex:none;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};font-weight:700}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward strong,.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward small{display:block}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward strong{font-size:13px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward small{margin-top:3px;font-size:11px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};color:#343a29}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow svg{width:18px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:16px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill{border:1px solid rgba(246,242,229,.5);border-radius:99px;padding:6px 9px;font-size:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill svg{width:12px;height:12px;color:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact{margin-top:clamp(66px,8vw,110px)}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(28px,8vw,100px);align-items:end;margin-bottom:39px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-title{font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,40px);line-height:1.1;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:40px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item{border-top:1px solid rgba(199,199,173,.45);padding-top:23px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-icon{width:44px;height:44px;border:1px solid rgba(233,172,41,.7);border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};margin-bottom:16px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-icon svg{width:22px;height:22px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item h3{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 9px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }};margin:0}
.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta{margin-top:70px;padding:48px;border-radius:28px;background:#F5F0E0;color:#3f4934;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta .ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{color:#5e6848}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-title{font-size:clamp(30px,3.1vw,40px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0 0 15px;color:#495239}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-copy{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#555b47;margin:0}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote{border-left:2px solid {{ block.settings.accent_color }};padding:4px 0 4px 18px;margin-top:23px;color:#495239;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signature{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#495239}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-image{height:330px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:18px;background:#e0ddd1}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-image img,.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-image svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-image svg{background:#ddd8cf}
@media(max-width:749px){.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:100%;padding:42px 21px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage{height:290px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact{margin-top:65px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;margin-bottom:30px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:23px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:27px;gap:24px;margin-top:55px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-image{height:250px}.ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{width:32px;height:32px}}
{% endstyle %}
<section class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__wrap"><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top"><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">GIVING BACK</p><h2 class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">Outgrown,<br>Not Outworn.</h2><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro">{{ block.settings.intro }}</div><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage"><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--one">{% if block.settings.return_image %}<img src="{{ block.settings.return_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.return_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__missing">Add a return box image</span>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--two">{% if block.settings.garment_image %}<img src="{{ block.settings.garment_image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.garment_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__missing">Add a garment image</span>{% endif %}</div><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tag ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tag--a">Step 01 · Return</span><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tag ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tag--b">Step 02 · Redistribute</span><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__seal"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 7v5h-5M4 17v-5h5M5.5 9A7 7 0 0 1 18 6l2 6M4 12l2 6a7 7 0 0 0 12-3"/></svg><br>RETURN · REWARD · REDISTRIBUTE</span></div></div></div><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__right"><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">OUR UNIQUE INITIATIVE</p><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards"><article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cardhead"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__round-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="m3 7 9-4 9 4-9 4-9-4Zm0 0v10l9 4 9-4V7m-9 4v10"/></svg></span><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step">STEP 01</p><h3>Return &amp; Reward</h3></div></div><p>When your little one outgrows our beautiful clothes, don't let them gather dust. Send them back to us!</p><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__percent">15%</span><div><strong>Off your next Kiss &amp; Kry purchase</strong><small>as a token of our appreciation.</small></div></div></article><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span><article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--dark"><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cardhead"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__round-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="m3 10 9-7 9 7v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6v-7h-4v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V10Z"/></svg></span><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step">STEP 02</p><h3>Redistribute &amp; Rejoice</h3></div></div><p>We don't just collect used clothes — we make sure they find a new home within our community.</p><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pills"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill">✓ Inspected</span><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill">✓ Cleaned</span><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill">✓ Given to families in need</span></div></article></div></div></div>
<div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact"><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-intro"><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">THE IMPACT</p><h2 class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-title">Making a Difference<br>Together.</h2></div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-copy">By joining our Giving Back programme, you're directly helping build a more sustainable future — and supporting those less fortunate. Small actions make a big difference, and with your help we can extend the life of our premium baby clothes and reduce waste.</p></div><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-grid"><article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 4c-9 0-15 4-15 11 0 3 2 5 5 5 7 0 11-7 10-16Z"/><path d="M5 19c3-5 6-8 11-11"/></svg></span><h3>Sustainability</h3><p>By recycling our garments, we reduce waste and promote a more sustainable fashion industry. Every returned item is one less piece of clothing that could end up in a landfill.</p></article><article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M3 20v-1a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v1M16 5a3 3 0 0 1 0 6m2 3a5 5 0 0 1 3 5v1"/></svg></span><h3>Community Support</h3><p>By passing returned clothes on to those in need, we strengthen our community and support families who may not have the means to buy new clothes.</p></article><article class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-item"><span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__impact-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.8 8.6c0 5.3-8.8 11-8.8 11s-8.8-5.7-8.8-11A4.6 4.6 0 0 1 12 6.2a4.6 4.6 0 0 1 8.8 2.4Z"/></svg></span><h3>Customer Connection</h3><p>This initiative lets us build a deeper bond with our customers — a sense of shared purpose and mutual benefit that goes well beyond the checkout.</p></article></div></div>
<div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta"><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">JOIN US</p><h2 class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-title">Join Us in Making<br>a Difference.</h2><p class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-copy">When you choose Kiss &amp; Kry, you're not just dressing your baby in the finest clothing — you're contributing to a cycle of generosity and care. Together, we can create a brighter, more sustainable future for all our children.</p><blockquote class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote">Thank you for being a valued member of the Kiss &amp; Kry family. Together, we can make a difference, one adorable outfit at a time.<span class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signature">♥ WITH LOVE, TEAM KISS &amp; KRY</span></blockquote></div><div class="ai-giving-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta-image">{% if block.settings.cta_image %}<img src="{{ block.settings.cta_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.cta_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}{% endif %}</div></div></div></section>
